(;FF[4]CA[UTF-8]GM[1]SZ[19]GN[It can be imagined that after a move of exchanging the black triangle and the white triangle in the second pattern (seven - stone pattern), the black stone at the square position descends on the right. In fact, this exchange is a terrible move. As can be known from the second pattern, a simple descent can ensure a clean life. This exchange has the implication of turning the black stones into a six - stone pattern (the first pattern), although it's not very accurate. Even so, it should be known that a simple move won't succeed.]GC[Type: Life & Death | Level: 8K | Rating: 4.6/5 | Correct: 54% (14054/26164) | Desc: It can be imagined that after a move of exchanging the black triangle and the white triangle in the second pattern (seven - stone pattern), the black stone at the square position descends on the right. In fact, this exchange is a terrible move. As can be known from the second pattern, a simple descent can ensure a clean life. This exchange has the implication of turning the black stones into a six - stone pattern (the first pattern), although it's not very accurate. Even so, it should be known that a simple move won't succeed. | First move: White]AB[rc]AB[sc]AB[rd]AB[re]AB[rf]AB[rg]AB[rh]AB[ri]AB[sj]AW[qb]AW[rb]AW[qc]AW[qd]AW[qe]AW[qf]AW[qg]AW[qh]AW[qi]AW[si]AW[rj]AW[rk](;W[se](;B[sf];W[sh];B[sg];W[si]C[RIGHT])(;B[sh];W[sf]C[RIGHT]))(;W[sh];B[sg](;W[si];B[se]C[WRONG])(;W[se];B[si]C[WRONG]))(;W[sk];B[sh]C[WRONG]))